@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-10-15

Feature: Manifest Sync Command
  "CLI handler for mason sync: reconcile local cache from the authoritative remote manifest."

  Provides:
    - cli.newSyncCommand @source("symbol:newSyncCommand")
    - cli.defaultSyncRun @source("symbol:defaultSyncRun")

  Consumes:
    - cli.shareStack
    - remote.Sync

  Invariants:
    - defaultSyncRun MUST pass stderr as the divergence warn writer
    - JSON output MUST expose updated and diverged booleans
    - Quiet mode MUST suppress human success messages

  Scenario (happy-path): Cache already current
    Given local cache matches remote
    When mason sync runs
    Then human output reports already up to date

  Scenario (happy-path): Cache updated
    Given stale or absent cache
    When mason sync runs
    Then human output reports synced from remote

  Scenario (happy-path): Divergence warning
    Given a pre-existing cache that differed from remote
    When mason sync runs
    Then stderr receives a divergence warning and JSON diverged is true

  Scenario (negative): Sync failure
    Given remote.Sync returns an error
    When defaultSyncRun runs
    Then the command propagates the failure
